oordination and strategy in competitive events\n•  Media Head, Effulgence(Techfest) — managed promotions and outreach\n•  Event Head, Google Developer Groups — organized technical events","blockchainVerified":false,"createdAt":{"$$date":1776889816708},"_id":"I6LfiGGA3mKpg0pL"}
